Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "ConstructionSiteOcclusion" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :excavator1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:excavator1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large construction excavator obstructing lane" .

:rainy1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Excavator bucket obscures view of oncoming lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Excavator bucket partially intruding into driving lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Excavator bucket obscures view of oncoming lane
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Excavator bucket partially intruding into driving lane
Severity Score: 0.65